{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19823","headline":"百忧 · 孟郊","name":"百忧","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"萱草女儿花，不解壮士忧。\n壮士心是剑，爲君射斗牛。\n朝思除国讐，暮思除国讐。\n计尽山河画，意穷草木筹。\n智士日千虑，愚夫唯四愁。\n何必在波涛，然後惊沈浮。\n伯伦心不醉，四皓迹难留。\n出处各有时，衆议徒啾啾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19823.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19823","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}